			description: [
				"  &3--------&r  &bRight Click to Collect&r  &3--------&r"
				""
				"&eSneak and right-click a scrap pile with an empty hand. Loose screws, rubber, synthetic fibers, leather, and ash can be pulled free. The compact remains become a small scrap block.&r"
				""
				"&eSharp edges can injure you. Finish a few piles, check your health, and eat before continuing.&r"
